# Figma Code Connect — local only. Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in.
# Never commit real values: this repository is public, and a Figma file key
# identifies a private design file.

# Personal access token. Required scopes:
#   Code Connect  = Write
#   File content  = Read
# https://help.figma.com/hc/en-us/articles/8085703771159-Manage-personal-access-tokens
FIGMA_ACCESS_TOKEN=

# One entry per connected component, named after the <FIGMA_<COMPONENT>_URL>
# placeholder in that component's .figma.ts templates — e.g. FIGMA_RADIO_URL.
# To get a value: right-click the component in Figma and choose
# "Copy link to selection". The URL must include a node-id to the component or component set.
#
# FIGMA_<COMPONENT>_URL=
